}
/* In flow the text-heavy margin goes: cards, tools, conversations. It is
   dismissed, not dimmed, so nothing invisible keeps focus or the pointer.
   The desk (post and galley slip) stays: it is what flow leaves behind,
   and the post is the way back. Nothing is deleted; a pause, Escape or the
   post brings it all back as it was. */
[data-flow="flow"] .flow-surface > :not(.flow-desk),
[data-flow="flow"] .in-flow-rails,
[data-flow="flow"] .manuscript-comment-card.is-in-margin,
